# T016：沿用 t015.http 注册设备并获取用户 JWT；以下变量只在本地 HTTP 客户端填写。
# deviceToken 仅在注册响应返回一次，不要提交真实值。
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1
@operatorAdminToken = REPLACE_LOCAL_JWT
@taskId = REPLACE_TASK_UUID
@subtaskId = REPLACE_SUBTASK_UUID
@replacementDeviceId = REPLACE_ENABLED_DEVICE_UUID
@expectedSubtaskLockVersion = 1
@oldDeviceId = REPLACE_OLD_DEVICE_UUID
@oldDeviceToken = REPLACE_PRIVATE_TOKEN
@oldExecutionId = REPLACE_OLD_EXECUTION_UUID
@oldRequirementId = REPLACE_REQUIREMENT_UUID
@oldUploadClientRequestId = REPLACE_NEW_CLIENT_REQUEST_UUID
@oldUploadId = REPLACE_UPLOAD_UUID

### 当前批次进度与资料缺失汇总；PENDING 版本 present=true，但 acceptanceReady=false
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAdminToken}}

### 人工换机：RUNNING / WAITING_ACCEPTANCE 下 reason 必填，CAS 使用子任务 lockVersion
# 并发使用同一 expectedLockVersion，只有一个成功；旧执行 CLOSED，新执行 RUNNING/progress=0。
POST {{baseUrl}}/subtasks/{{subtaskId}}/executions
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"droneId":"{{replacementDeviceId}}","expectedLockVersion":{{expectedSubtaskLockVersion}},"reason":"旧设备电量不足，人工更换设备继续巡检"}

### 查看执行历史：current / previousExecutionId / adjustedBy / adjustmentReason / adjustedAt
GET {{baseUrl}}/subtasks/{{subtaskId}}/executions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAdminToken}}

### 旧设备对 CLOSED 原批次补传历史资料；新设备不能借用旧 executionId
POST {{baseUrl}}/device/upload-sessions
X-Device-Id: {{oldDeviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{oldDeviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"clientRequestId":"{{oldUploadClientRequestId}}","requirementId":"{{oldRequirementId}}","executionId":"{{oldExecutionId}}","filename":"late-history.png","contentType":"image/png","size":79}

### 传片重试沿用同一 uploadId / partNo 和相同字节
PUT {{baseUrl}}/device/upload-sessions/{{oldUploadId}}/parts/1
X-Device-Id: {{oldDeviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{oldDeviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./files/inspection-sample.png

### 202 表示异步定版已接纳；轮询得到 COMPLETED 才有固定版本
POST {{baseUrl}}/device/upload-sessions/{{oldUploadId}}/complete
X-Device-Id: {{oldDeviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{oldDeviceToken}}

### 即使旧批次后来得到更大 versionNo，当前汇总仍只读取 currentExecutionId 的最新版本
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorAdminToken}}
